Add algebra::structure pass

Rust-side reimplementation of the eqlog.eql Structure, El, pred_app,
func_app, var, and el-type machinery. A Structure over a Signature
carries a flat Vec<El>, a BTreeSet<PredApp>, and a
BTreeMap<FuncApp, ElId>. PredApp and FuncApp are data-keyed structs
holding the relation id, parent model els, and arguments.

build_structures walks each rule body and assigns a before- and
after-structure to every statement. After is produced by cloning
before and extending it with whatever the statement introduces. No
morphisms, no unification, no equating of elements.

Widens Signature with PredDeclId -> PredId, FuncDeclId -> FuncId,
CtorDeclId -> FuncId lookups and Type/Pred/Func data accessors.
